## Dot-repeat for unnamed deletes
#X i

// Inline delete, repeat inline delete.
B0 |aaa␊bbb␊ccc␊ddd␊
K dw 3gg0 .
B1 ␊bbb␊|␊ddd␊

B0 |aaa␊bbb␊ccc␊ddd␊
K dw 3gg0 . X
B1 ␊bbb␊␊ddd␊0:␊1:ccc␊-:ccc␊a:␊":ccc␊

// Multiline delete, repeat inline delete.
B0 |aaa␊bbb␊ccc␊ddd␊
K d2w 4gg0 .
B1 ccc␊|␊

B0 |aaa␊bbb␊ccc␊ddd␊
K d2w 4gg0 . X
B1 ccc␊␊0:␊1:ddd␊-:ddd␊a:␊":ddd␊

// Inline delete, repeat multiline delete.
B0 aaa␊bbb␊ccc␊|ddd␊
K d2w gg0 .
B1 |ccc␊␊

B0 aaa␊bbb␊ccc␊|ddd␊
K d2w gg0 . X
B1 ccc␊␊0:␊1:aaa␊bbb␊-:ddd␊a:␊":aaa␊bbb␊

// Multiline delete, repeat multiline delete.
B0 |aaa␊bbb␊ccc␊ddd␊
K d2w .
B1 |␀

B0 |aaa␊bbb␊ccc␊ddd␊
K d2w . X
B1 ␊0:␊1:ccc␊ddd␊-:␊a:␊":ccc␊ddd␊
